th respect to associate  biology but we might look at it in a  broader sense and say that what Singer  is saying here has implications for  accounts of ethics generally that it's  really important that we be able to find  some way of incorporating motives why  because that is how people actually do  judge whether people are altruistic or  not they focus on why a person is  engaging in the action  you
 

